          "Vincas Krėvė’s psychological historical drama “Šarūnas” is dated 1911 by the Universal Lithuanian Encyclopedia and was staged in 1924, 1929, 1966 and 1980; its hero is a legendary prince. This is a literary episode. The 1964 calendar reprinted by Salys places Šarūnas (Šaras) on 19 February, unlike the project calendar’s 24 January."
